"miltownbucky.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T16:49:36.395Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T16:49:39.056Z", "text": "Yep, crazy story. \n\nfortune.com/2026/10/16/w..."}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-19T17:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr/app.bsky.feed.post/3myandxa5ys2x", "author_did": "did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr", "handle": "jimowczarski.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:27:25.398Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T17:27:25.665Z", "text": "The Milwaukee Bucks have until 4 p.m. to move one guaranteed contract off their roster. \n\nThey are practicing this afternoon."}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-19T18:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:jxbssw4jykdzayen3latphgt/app.bsky.feed.post/3myarxdupsc2w", "author_did": "did:plc:jxbssw4jykdzayen3latphgt", "handle": "allaboutthebucks.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:49:51.157Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T18:49:53.553Z", "text": "The new Bucks won't play the best basketball in the NBA, but they have plenty of players that can be really fun to watch.\n\nBurries finishes, Sims dunks, Jakucionis passes, Ware versatile plays... And we got a lot of them in preseason.\nwww.youtube.com/watch?v=Z5rT..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:v4isqjnoxjxnkidbpvmye22e/app.bsky.feed.post/3myaqrciyka27", "author_did": "did:plc:v4isqjnoxjxnkidbpvmye22e", "handle": "sportsworldwide.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:28:29Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T18:28:35.254Z", "text": "Giannis Antetokounmpo Calls Out Team Effort After Loss to Thunder\n\n#Bucks #Featured #NBANewsandRumors #News\n\nhttps://justpaste.in/sports/giannis-antetokounmpo-calls-out-team-effort-after-loss-to-thunder/"}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-19T19:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-19T20:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:sa73fbx3vxzh2fw5pu5wmief/app.bsky.feed.post/3myaz4x6cu52v", "author_did": "did:plc:sa73fbx3vxzh2fw5pu5wmief", "handle": "shamsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T20:54:21.000Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T20:58:15.955Z", "text": "The Milwaukee Bucks have waived guard Kevin Porter Jr., sources tell ESPN."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr/app.bsky.feed.post/3myawsyltks2f", "author_did": "did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr", "handle": "jimowczarski.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T20:16:53.824Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T20:16:58.423Z", "text": "Jaime Jaquez Jr. spoke after Bucks practice: \n\nHe said his mindset hasn't changed regarding an extension other than instead of taking it \"day-by-day\" he's going \"hour-by-hour\" at this point regarding a potential rookie scale extension with his new team. \n\nwww.jsonline.com/story/sports..."}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-19T21:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:mrvbh3rnv4jmde3ijv4hj4mh/app.bsky.feed.post/3myb3cowtne2o", "author_did": "did:plc:mrvbh3rnv4jmde3ijv4hj4mh", "handle": "us-med.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T21:37:07+00:00", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T21:37:16.256Z", "text": ""}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3myazqab2322y", "author_did": "did:plc:e3ktrbooe3mildj4hhwhsvtc", "handle": "mikeascotto.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T21:09:02.416Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T21:09:06.666Z", "text": "Sources: The Milwaukee Bucks have waived Kevin Porter Jr. He averaged 17.4 points, 7.4 assists, 5.2 rebounds, and 2.2 steals per game for the Bucks last season."}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-19T22:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:qq6tpffju3hto3n3p4hrfekm/app.bsky.feed.post/3myb7mbhq5c2d", "author_did": "did:plc:qq6tpffju3hto3n3p4hrfekm", "handle": "queensicez.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T22:54:11.922Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T22:54:14.460Z", "text": "br.app.link/PswARmFkn7b.    #NBA"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr/app.bsky.feed.post/3myb7gtdrfs2f", "author_did": "did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr", "handle": "jimowczarski.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T22:51:09.339Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T22:51:09.656Z", "text": "New Bucks head coach Taylor Jenkins had thoughts on the impending roster move the team was going to make just an hour before it was done: \n\ud83d\udc47\nwww.jsonline.com/story/sports..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:vq47dnnhpwl2jir45t2vd76i/app.bsky.feed.post/3myb52xwhlc22", "author_did": "did:plc:vq47dnnhpwl2jir45t2vd76i", "handle": "jimmyfk.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T22:08:44.010Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T22:08:44.366Z", "text": "I do not work at/for the Athletic, but considering they do not have someone covering the Brewers or the Badgers full time, I think we can safely assume they are not going to cover the post-Giannis Milwaukee Bucks."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:gyxmfluwk6uqvr6v3tpjgvmi/app.bsky.feed.post/3myb4oklgps2p", "author_did": "did:plc:gyxmfluwk6uqvr6v3tpjgvmi", "handle": "coyote.band", "created_at": "2026-10-19T22:01:47.364Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T22:01:47.855Z", "text": "the only Milwaukee Bucks playoff game I saw live, they lost. then they lost the series"}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-19T23:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:lvcs7ffkwlksfks5xd7sbene/app.bsky.feed.post/3mybcitqhyp24", "author_did": "did:plc:lvcs7ffkwlksfks5xd7sbene", "handle": "channel3000.com", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:45:58.028Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T23:45:59.457Z", "text": "The Milwaukee Bucks waived guard Kevin Porter Jr. on Monday after a 2025-26 season in which he led the team in assists per game and ranked second in scoring."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:wcx6hflrpuasjl5tik7xqiwz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mybcg7wru22i", "author_did": "did:plc:wcx6hflrpuasjl5tik7xqiwz", "handle": "stevemegargee.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:44:30.217Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T23:44:30.464Z", "text": "Milwaukee #Bucks waive Kevin Porter Jr. as they finalize their season-opening roster shorturl.at/1xyOo"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr/app.bsky.feed.post/3mybax2bhg22f", "author_did": "did:plc:6jpqgc6d4tplxcioxuh7khmr", "handle": "jimowczarski.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:18:07.216Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T23:18:07.357Z", "text": "Bucks GM Jon Horst has been pretty up front the team might not extend Jaime Jaquez Jr. or Tyler Herro. It should not be a surprise the first deadline came and went. \n\n\u201cWe have to exercise complete caution. And patience. This is a massive opportunity for us.\" - Horst\nwww.jsonline.com/story/sports..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:tl4p5gf6advrvxq6a6om5r4b/app.bsky.feed.post/3myba24kj3r2q", "author_did": "did:plc:tl4p5gf6advrvxq6a6om5r4b", "handle": "sports-wire.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:01:56Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T23:01:57.259Z", "text": "Sports Wire: Bucks Pass On Option For Jaime Jaquez"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:bfggb2knuaytsofzqofi4ocd/app.bsky.feed.post/3myba24rw2d2m", "author_did": "did:plc:bfggb2knuaytsofzqofi4ocd", "handle": "sports-area.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:01:56Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T23:01:57.753Z", "text": "Bucks Pass On Option For Jaime Jaquez"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:uypucti3laehjouuvvc7jccl/app.bsky.feed.post/3myb7zajxtc2w", "author_did": "did:plc:uypucti3laehjouuvvc7jccl", "handle": "nextstamina.com", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:01:27Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-19T23:01:27.867Z", "text": "Bucks Pass On Option For Jaime Jaquez"}]}]